English summary (the Russian text prevails):
LocalCode is free to use for personal and commercial purposes. No activation
keys, no subscription, no registration. You may install it on any number of your
computers, study the code and modify it for yourself. You may not sell it or
pass it off as your own product, redistribute modified builds as official
LocalCode builds, add malware, or remove the authorship and integrity files.
The official build is the one whose files match the signed `integrity.json`.
Provided "as is" without warranties; liability is limited as far as the law
allows. Consumer rights under mandatory law are not affected.
